                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1f3a5f' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='22'>Bondora Credit Risk: Where do defaults come from?</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Loans issued 2023–2025 · 410,865 loans</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
